[h1]Languages[/h1][url=https://lyuwenhan.github.io/extensions/minecraft-java/data/assets/best-armor/README/README.html]EN/English[/url] | [url=https://lyuwenhan.github.io/extensions/minecraft-java/data/assets/best-armor/README/README_ZH-CN.html]ZH-CN/简体中文[/url]
[h1]Best Armor[/h1]A lightweight [b]client-side Fabric mod[/b] that adds three prebuilt administrator shulker boxes to the operator creative tab.
[hr]
[h2]Overview[/h2]Best Armor adds three preset shulker boxes to the operator-only creative tab.
The boxes are designed as three equipment tiers:
[list]
[*]The yellow shulker box contains the best equipment that can be obtained through normal Survival gameplay.[/*]
[*]The orange shulker box looks almost identical to the yellow set from the outside, but its internal attributes are much higher.[/*]
[*]The red shulker box contains equipment with very high visible and internal power.[/*]
[/list]Each set includes:
[list]
[*]A normal netherite chestplate[/*]
[*]A vanilla elytra[/*]
[*]A Glideplate-style netherite chestplate with gliding support[/*]
[/list]The mod does not register new items, blocks, commands, screens, or configuration files. It directly generates existing item stacks in code and adds them to the operator creative tab.
[hr]
[h2]Key Features[/h2][list]
[*]Adds three prebuilt shulker boxes to the operator creative tab[/*]
[*]Includes yellow, orange, and red equipment presets[/*]
[*]Uses vanilla shulker boxes with preconfigured container contents[/*]
[*]Includes normal chestplates, elytra, and Glideplate-style chestplates[/*]
[*]Generates all items directly in Java code[/*]
[*]Does not load item definitions from text files[/*]
[*]Does not parse [b]/give[/b] command strings[/*]
[*]Does not register custom items or blocks[/*]
[*]No commands or configuration required[/*]
[*]Client-side only[/*]
[*]Lightweight with minimal runtime logic[/*]
[/list][hr]
[h2]Equipment Tiers[/h2][h3]Yellow Shulker Box[/h3]The yellow shulker box contains the best practical equipment obtainable in Survival gameplay.
It is designed as a clean, high-end Survival equipment set with strong vanilla-style enchantments and no hidden extreme attributes.
[h3]Orange Shulker Box[/h3]The orange shulker box is designed to look almost the same as the yellow set at first glance.
Its equipment uses a similar external appearance, but the internal attributes are much higher. This makes it suitable for administrator use while keeping the visual style close to normal survival gear.
[h3]Red Shulker Box[/h3]The red shulker box contains the strongest preset set.
Its equipment has very high enchantment levels and very high internal attributes. It is intended as the full-power administrator equipment preset.
[hr]
[h2]Chestplate and Elytra Setup[/h2]Each shulker box includes both normal armor and flight-related equipment.
The normal netherite chestplate is kept as a regular chestplate, without Glideplate item data. This allows the set to retain a clean armor option.
Each box also includes a vanilla elytra as a separate item.
In addition, each box includes the original Glideplate-style netherite chestplate. This chestplate uses Glideplate-compatible item data and gliding support, allowing it to behave like a chestplate with elytra-style functionality.
The Glideplate-style chestplate is marked for compatibility with [url=https://modrinth.com/mod/glideplate]Glideplate[/url].
No server-side Glideplate installation is required for these preset item stacks to be generated by this mod. Installing Glideplate on the client can improve Glideplate-related item and equipment visuals.
[hr]
[h2]Visual Behavior[/h2][list]
[*]The three shulker boxes appear in the operator creative tab[/*]
[*]The yellow box represents the best normal Survival-style set[/*]
[*]The orange box looks similar to the yellow set but contains stronger hidden attributes[/*]
[*]The red box represents the strongest full-power set[/*]
[*]Each set includes a normal chestplate, a vanilla elytra, and a Glideplate-style chestplate[/*]
[*]No custom UI or overlay is added[/*]
[*]No custom textures or models are required by this mod[/*]
[/list][hr]
[h2]Multiplayer Safety[/h2][list]
[*]Client-side only[/*]
[*]No server modifications are required by this mod[/*]
[*]Server authority still applies[/*]
[*]Creative inventory item stacks may be validated or rejected by the server[/*]
[*]Some servers may not allow modified creative inventory items[/*]
[*]Use on multiplayer servers only where administrator tools of this type are allowed[/*]
[/list][hr]
[h2]Supported Versions[/h2][list]
[*]Minecraft 26.1.2[/*]
[*]Fabric Loader 0.19.2+[/*]
[*]Fabric API 0.150.0+[/*]
[*]Java 25[/*]
[/list][hr]
